            "systems.reads-from"
          ]
        }
      },
      "caption": {
        "title": "Four packages",
        "text": "Visual Anything is one local program and a browser app, in four packages:\n\n- core: the model, commands and the undo history, with no I/O\n- schema: the project files' types and their JSON Schema\n- server: the local program, which owns the model\n- app: the React UI, drawn with PixiJS"
      },
      "marks": [
        "core-hnt4ih",
        "schema-nd8g5w",
        "server-w4u6le",
        "app-kk6aff"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "step-1ou439",
      "viewState": {
        "view": "overview",
        "select": [
          "session-839z14"
        ],
        "focus": {
          "degrees": 1,
          "direction": "both"
        }
      },
      "caption": {
        "title": "The session owns the model",
        "text": "Every edit, the person's or Claude's, reaches the session as a command. It runs the command through core, saves the files it changes and records one action in the history."
      },
      "marks": [
        "session-839z14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "step-x13zan",
      "viewState": {
        "view": "a-command-s-path-5np65s"
      },
      "caption": {
        "title": "A shape moves",
        "text": "One drag on the canvas, recorded from a real session: from the gesture to the view file, and back to every open tab."
      },
